ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N3HmE4DStZ0Q7kNvwFrSOwp&_nc_oc=Adpkw3TEqPhp94ht9afg_OZJhHaRIpTVidfD4cmzJ-kyMgmXCe39U0Ltmqn3I_FesvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9D1fmhRFAv3fVzbrxTEcA6neGTzf9ciQPVuP4069rBLQ&oe=6A243AFC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vy_tV0lMfAIQ7kNvwFGgwNV&_nc_oc=AdocIjL60Y1AP8oPCiLAf60ukvb0e-9lb6ldruAmY79C6cyxUzkRgYvyWbaSVf-f8uM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-J3BpUdklf1AMrXDBJjJFxAUXBBnqglJsbJpy7Xb6nTw&oe=6A241F16"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0kScalyaFnwQ7kNvwEhioqG&_nc_oc=AdpV5T1v275wF9ONqG2FUhy5_hX653mnWknzLpBf_ZIypF79QNvw8KkjxoFHv0Xroto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8AMP4tFIPW8q-war5KT8q6qPA_cxZ3iCrl_W39848Nlw&oe=6A242CE4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_